{"id":"n21350-1-6","stage":4,"title":"과찬 · 过奖","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n21350-1-6-1","ko":"노래를 가수처럼 매우 잘하시네요.","zh":"您的唱歌技巧真好，简直像专业歌手一样。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"노래를","meaning":"歌，歌曲，唱歌","explanation":"노래：歌，歌曲，唱歌；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"노래","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20195","senseId":"1","lemma":"노래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"노래를","audio":"/audio/e4d8b71da5f5c71ee421.mp3"}},{"text":"가수처럼","meaning":"歌手","explanation":"가수：歌手；처럼：表示相似：“像……一样”。","readings":[{"term":"가수","audio":"/audio/9e173c93773cc5589668.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62256","senseId":"1","lemma":"가수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가수처럼","audio":"/audio/8fd7c9405f36dcad63d1.mp3"}},{"text":"매우","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"매우：非常，极其，很。","readings":[{"term":"매우","audio":"/audio/6226ddde2c49b372f0a1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61510","senseId":"1","lemma":"매우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"매우","audio":"/audio/6226ddde2c49b372f0a1.mp3"}},{"text":"잘하시네요.","meaning":"棒","explanation":"잘하다：棒；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"잘하다","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70073","senseId":"2","lemma":"잘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘하시네요","audio":"/audio/be2172aa5ff44d495fb8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"edcad1c9c3dba9e9","term":"노래","zh":"歌，歌曲，唱歌","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3","entryId":"20195","definition":"给具有韵律的歌词添加曲子的音乐；或放声唱出那样的音乐。","pronunciation":["노래"]},{"id":"9e173c93773cc558","term":"가수","zh":"歌手","audio":"/audio/9e173c93773cc5589668.mp3","entryId":"62256","definition":"以唱歌为职业的人。","pronunciation":["가수"]},{"id":"6226ddde2c49b372","term":"매우","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/6226ddde2c49b372f0a1.mp3","entryId":"61510","definition":"表示远远超出了普通程度。","pronunciat